---
const guides = [
  {
    title: "Get started",
    description: "Find your way around your first server.",
    href: "/docs/getting-started/intro/",
  },
  {
    title: "Manage server power",
    description: "Understand start, stop, and restart controls.",
    href: "/docs/servers/power/",
  },
  {
    title: "Plan your recovery",
    description: "Know what snapshots and backups can protect.",
    href: "/docs/servers/backups/",
  },
];
---

<section class="help-section py-12 md:py-16" aria-labelledby="help-heading">
  <h2 id="help-heading" class="help-heading">Help when you need it</h2>
  <p class="help-intro">
    Find a guide, check service status, or contact support. Keep service and
    account details in private support channels.
  </p>

  <div class="help-grid">
    <article class="help-card docs-card">
      <div>
        <h3>Find your next step</h3>
        <p>Practical guides for access, server controls, and recovery.</p>
      </div>
      <nav class="guide-list" aria-label="Server guides">
        {
          guides.map((guide) => (
            <a class="guide-link" href={guide.href}>
              <span>
                <strong>{guide.title}</strong>
                <span class="guide-description">{guide.description}</span>
              </span>
              <svg
                width="20"
                height="20"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                aria-hidden="true">
                <path
                  d="m9 6 6 6-6 6"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="1.5"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                />
              </svg>
            </a>
          ))
        }
      </nav>
      <a class="help-link" href="/docs/">Read docs</a>
    </article>

    <article class="help-card status-card">
      <h3>Check service status</h3>
      <p>
        Check for an active incident before troubleshooting. If the status page
        is unavailable, contact support through Client Panel.
      </p>
      <a
        class="help-link"
        href="https://uptime.8labs.id"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Open status <span class="new-tab">(new tab)</span>
      </a>
    </article>

    <article class="help-card support-card">
      <h3>Keep support private</h3>
      <p>
        Send account, service, security, or abuse concerns through private
        support in Client Panel. Include the affected service and a redacted
        error, never passwords or access tokens.
      </p>
      <a class="help-link" href="/docs/help/contact/">Contact support</a>
    </article>

    <article class="help-card backup-card">
      <div class="backup-copy">
        <h3>Keep an independent backup</h3>
        <p>
          Keep a separate copy of important data. A snapshot can share your
          server’s storage: losing that storage can mean losing both. Snapshots
          are not a replacement for an independent backup.
        </p>
        <p>Backup and recovery options depend on your selected plan.</p>
        <a class="help-link" href="/docs/servers/backups/">Understand backups</a
        >
      </div>
      <figure
        class="backup-diagram"
        aria-label="A server and snapshot can share storage. Keep an independent backup on separate storage.">
        <div class="shared-storage">
          <div class="storage-pair">
            <span class="storage-item">Server</span>
            <span class="storage-item">Snapshot</span>
          </div>
          <span class="storage-caption">Can share the same storage</span>
        </div>
        <div class="copy-connector" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>Separate copy</span>
        </div>
        <div class="independent-storage">
          <span class="storage-item">Independent backup</span>
          <span class="storage-caption">Separate storage</span>
        </div>
      </figure>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .help-section {
    color: #18181b;
  }
  .help-heading {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }
  .help-intro {
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin: 16px 0 0;
    color: #52525b;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .help-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }
  .help-card {
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 24px;
    border: 1px solid #e4e4e7;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .help-card h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .help-card p {
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    color: #52525b;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .docs-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background: #fafafa;
  }
  .docs-card h3 {
    font-size: 28px;
  }
  .guide-list {
    display: grid;
    margin: 24px 0 8px;
  }
  .guide-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 20px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #e4e4e7;
    color: #18181b;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .guide-link:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e4e7;
  }
  .guide-link strong {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .guide-description {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 5px;
    color: #52525b;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .guide-link svg {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    color: #c20e50;
  }
  .help-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    align-self: flex-start;
    min-height: 44px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    color: #18181b;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
    text-decoration-color: #a1a1aa;
  }
  .help-link:hover,
  .guide-link:hover strong {
    color: #c20e50;
  }
  .help-link:focus-visible,
  .guide-link:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid #c20e50;
    outline-offset: 5px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .new-tab {
    color: #52525b;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .backup-diagram {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 24px 0 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .shared-storage,
  .independent-storage {
    padding: 16px;
    border: 1px solid #e4e4e7;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #fafafa;
  }
  .storage-pair {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .storage-item {
    display: block;
    padding: 12px 8px;
    border: 1px solid #e4e4e7;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #fff;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .storage-caption {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 10px;
    color: #52525b;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .independent-storage .storage-item {
    border-color: #c20e50;
  }
  .copy-connector {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
    min-height: 52px;
    color: #52525b;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .copy-connector::before,
  .copy-connector::after {
    content: "";
    width: 1px;
    height: 20px;
    background: #a1a1aa;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .help-heading {
      font-size: 36px;
    }
    .help-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .docs-card {
      grid-row: span 2;
    }
    .docs-card h3 {
      font-size: 32px;
    }
    .docs-card .help-link {
      margin-top: auto;
    }
    .backup-card {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
    .backup-diagram {
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .shared-storage,
    .independent-storage {
      flex: 1;
    }
    .copy-connector {
      flex-direction: column;
      padding: 0 16px;
    }
    .copy-connector::before,
    .copy-connector::after {
      width: 28px;
      height: 1px;
    }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1100px) {
    .help-card {
      padding: 32px;
    }
    .backup-card {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr);
      gap: 32px;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .backup-diagram {
      margin: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
